==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Magmar|21}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*'''Stoke''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Blaine's Growlithe|62}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Magmar}}.

